# Meld Playground

Test and experiment with Meld.js directly in your browser. Select an example from the presets, modify the code, and click **Run Code** to see the results live.

<div class="playground-container">
  <div class="playground-control-bar">
    <div class="preset-selector">
      <label for="example-presets">Load Example:</label>
      <select id="example-presets">
        <option value="counter">Simple Counter</option>
        <option value="todolist">Todo List (Dynamic Lists)</option>
        <option value="computed">Computed Properties</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <button class="playground-btn" id="run-btn">
